{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw Dify on ACK in Frankfurt, calling Model Studio for Qwen and reading company documents from OSS."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","ack","dify-on-ack","model-studio","oss","rds","tair","sls","nat"]}
{"t":"req","text":"Internal knowledge assistant"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"About 500 internal users","alt":"Over 5000 internal users"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Corporate network","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"internet","why":"Staff accessing the internal knowledge assistant."}
{"t":"group","id":"frankfurt","kind":"region","label":"Frankfurt (eu-central-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Dify VPC","parent":"frankfurt"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes internal traffic to the Dify cluster."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Kubernetes cluster hosting Dify workloads."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-ack","from":"alb","to":"ack"}
{"t":"node","id":"dify","product":"dify-on-ack","label":"Dify","group":"vpc","why":"Self-hosted low-code agent and RAG builder."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-dify","from":"ack","to":"dify"}
{"t":"say","text":"Adding databases, cache, storage and Model Studio for Qwen inference."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Dify metadata DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores Dify app configs, conversations and user data."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-db","from":"dify","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches sessions and speeds up RAG retrieval."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-cache","from":"dify","to":"cache"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Company documents","group":"frankfurt","why":"Holds company documents that Dify ingests for RAG."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-docs","from":"dify","to":"docs","label":"read docs"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Gives Dify outbound access to Model Studio APIs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-nat","from":"dify","to":"nat","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"qwen","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio (Qwen)","group":null,"why":"Provides hosted Qwen model inference for Dify."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-nat-qwen","from":"nat","to":"qwen","label":"API calls"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"frankfurt","why":"Collects Dify and ACK logs for troubleshooting."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-logs","from":"dify","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"vector-store","text":"Which vector store should Dify use for document embeddings?","options":["Elasticsearch","Milvus","RDS pgvector"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"access-method","text":"How will employees reach this internal assistant?","options":["Private ALB via VPN","Express Connect","SASE zero-trust"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Dify self-hosted on ACK in Frankfurt with RDS, Tair, OSS documents and Model Studio Qwen inference via NAT."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a product catalog API with ALB, ECS compute, RDS for catalog data, Tair cache and OSS for images. Elasticsearch is excluded."}
{"t":"req","text":"Elasticsearch is strictly banned due to licensing concerns","avoid":["elasticsearch"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","ecs","rds","tair","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"exposure","text":"Public-facing marketplace API","alt":"Internal only"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"About 10k daily users","alt":"Over 100k daily users"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Marketplace clients","group":"internet","why":"Buyers and sellers calling the catalog API."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the API domain to the load balancer."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Catalog VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes HTTPS traffic to API servers across zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"api","product":"ecs","label":"Catalog API servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the product catalog REST API in two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-api","from":"alb","to":"api"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Product cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches hot product lookups to reduce DB reads."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-cache","from":"api","to":"cache"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Catalog DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores products, categories and inventory data."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-db","from":"api","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"images","product":"oss","label":"Product images","group":"sg","why":"Stores product photos served by the API or CDN."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-images","from":"api","to":"images","label":"read/write"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"API logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes request logs and error alerts."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-logs","from":"api","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"image-delivery","text":"How should product images be delivered to buyers?","options":["Direct from OSS","CDN or ESA edge cache"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"search-need","text":"Do you need full-text search over product names and descriptions?","options":["Yes, add AnalyticDB","No, simple SQL filters"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Product catalog API behind ALB on ECS, with RDS database, Tair cache, OSS image storage and SLS logging, excluding Elasticsearch."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add AnalyticDB for fast full-text and fuzzy search over product titles, synced from RDS via DTS. Elasticsearch remains excluded."}
{"t":"req","text":"Elasticsearch is strictly banned due to licensing concerns","avoid":["elasticsearch"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["analyticdb","dts"]}
{"t":"node","id":"search","product":"analyticdb","label":"Product search","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Full-text and fuzzy search over product titles and descriptions."}
{"t":"node","id":"sync","product":"dts","label":"Catalog sync","group":"sg","why":"Streams catalog changes from RDS to AnalyticDB in near real time."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-search","from":"api","to":"search","label":"query"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-db-sync","from":"db","to":"sync","kind":"async"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-sync-search","from":"sync","to":"search","kind":"async"}
{"t":"ask","id":"image-delivery","text":"How should product images be delivered to buyers?","options":["Direct from OSS","CDN or ESA edge cache"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added AnalyticDB for full-text search with DTS syncing catalog data from RDS; Elasticsearch stays excluded per policy."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a claims portal in Tokyo with ECS, RDS and OSS for document storage, keeping all data in Japan."}
{"t":"req","text":"All policyholder data must remain physically within Japan","regions":["ap-northeast-1"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","rds","oss","sls","kms","certificate-management"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"exposure","text":"Public-facing portal for policyholders","alt":"Internal only via corporate network"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"About 50k policyholders submitting claims","alt":"Over 500k policyholders"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Policyholders","group":"internet","why":"保険契約者がクレームを提出する。"}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"ポータルドメインをESAに解決する。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"静的アセットをキャッシュしDDoSから保護する。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"tokyo","kind":"region","label":"Tokyo (ap-northeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Claims VPC","parent":"tokyo"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"2つのAZにトラフィックを分散する。"}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"OWASP攻撃やボットからポータルを守る。"}
{"t":"node","id":"cert","product":"certificate-management","label":"TLS Certificate","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"HTTPS通信のためのTLS証明書。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Portal servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"クレーム申請フォームと処理ロジックを実行。"}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"申請ピーク時にサーバーを自動追加する。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Claims DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"クレームデータと契約者情報を保存する。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Claim documents","group":"tokyo","why":"提出された証拠書類や画像を安全に保管。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-docs","from":"app","to":"docs","label":"upload"}
{"t":"node","id":"kms","product":"kms","label":"KMS","group":"tokyo","why":"データベースとOSSの暗号化キーを管理。"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"tokyo","why":"監査ログとアクセスログを一元管理。"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"auth-method","text":"How should policyholders authenticate to the portal?","options":["Email and password","SMS OTP","Corporate SSO"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"doc-review","text":"Do staff need a separate internal UI to review claims?","options":["Yes, add admin panel","No, API only for now"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"東京リージョンのクレームポータル：ESA、ALB+WAF、ECS（Auto Scaling）、RDS、OSS、KMS、SLSで構成。"}

{"t":"say","text":"Pinned rule: all policyholder data must stay in Tokyo. I cannot replicate claims data to Singapore."}
{"t":"say","text":"Instead, I'll add a read replica and analytics warehouse inside Tokyo for your team to query securely."}
{"t":"node","id":"db-read","product":"rds","label":"Claims read replica","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Read-only replica in Tokyo for analytics queries without impacting the primary."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-db-dbread","from":"db","to":"db-read","label":"replication","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"warehouse","product":"analyticdb","label":"Analytics warehouse","group":"vpc","why":"Columnar warehouse in Tokyo for fast reporting dashboards."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dbread-warehouse","from":"db-read","to":"warehouse","label":"ETL","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"bi","product":"quick-bi","label":"Quick BI dashboards","group":"tokyo","why":"Reporting dashboards querying the Tokyo warehouse."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-bi-warehouse","from":"bi","to":"warehouse","label":"queries"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added a Tokyo read replica, AnalyticDB warehouse and Quick BI; Singapore replication blocked by data residency rule."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add a Qwen chatbot to the portal. Model Studio runs in Tokyo, so all data stays in Japan."}
{"t":"node","id":"ai-gw","product":"ai-gateway","label":"AI Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Routes and rate-limits policyholder chat requests to Qwen models."}
{"t":"node","id":"qwen","product":"model-studio","label":"Qwen via Model Studio","group":"tokyo","why":"Answers policyholder questions using hosted Qwen in Tokyo."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-aigw","from":"app","to":"ai-gw","label":"chat"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-aigw-qwen","from":"ai-gw","to":"qwen","label":"LLM"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added AI Gateway in the VPC and Model Studio (Qwen) in Tokyo for the policyholder chatbot, keeping all data in Japan."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a live-streaming platform with Anti-DDoS Proxy scrubbing traffic before ESA, then ALB to app servers and cache."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","anti-ddos-proxy","esa","alb","waf","ecs","tair","live","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"region","text":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1) region","alt":"Another region"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"About 50k concurrent viewers","alt":"Over 500k concurrent viewers"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Viewers","group":"internet","why":"Audience watching live streams."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves domain to Anti-DDoS Proxy CNAME."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"ddos","product":"anti-ddos-proxy","label":"Anti-DDoS Proxy","group":"edge","why":"Scrubs large L3-L7 DDoS attacks before ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-ddos","from":"users","to":"ddos","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches static assets, accelerates dynamic API calls."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ddos-esa","from":"ddos","to":"esa","label":"scrubbed"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Streaming VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes traffic across app servers in two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks OWASP attacks and bots at the load balancer."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs streaming platform logic in two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores sessions and hot metadata for low latency."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"node","id":"live","product":"live","label":"ApsaraVideo Live","group":"sg","why":"Ingests, transcodes and delivers live video streams."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-live","from":"app","to":"live","label":"control","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Media storage","group":"sg","why":"Stores recordings, thumbnails and static assets."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-live-media","from":"live","to":"media","label":"recordings"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes access logs and security events."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-logs","from":"alb","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"stream-protocol","text":"Which ingest protocol do your streamers use?","options":["RTMP","SRT","WebRTC"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"viewer-region","text":"Where are most of your viewers located?","options":["Southeast Asia","Worldwide","China mainland"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Live-streaming architecture with Anti-DDoS Proxy scrubbing into ESA, ALB with WAF, ECS app servers, Tair cache, ApsaraVideo Live and OSS."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw your on-premises app servers connected privately to Jakarta VPC databases via Express Connect, with no public exposure."}
{"t":"req","text":"Data stays in Jakarta region","regions":["ap-southeast-5"]}
{"t":"req","text":"No public internet exposure for databases"}
{"t":"plan","products":["onprem-dc","express-connect","vpc","privatezone","mongodb","rds","cloudmonitor"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"db-ha","text":"Both databases deployed multi-AZ for high availability","alt":"Single-zone deployment to reduce cost"}
{"t":"group","id":"onprem","kind":"onprem","label":"Your Data Center","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"onprem-dc","product":"onprem-dc","label":"On-prem app servers","group":"onprem","why":"SaaS application servers running in your own facility."}
{"t":"group","id":"jakarta","kind":"region","label":"Jakarta (ap-southeast-5)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Database VPC","parent":"jakarta"}
{"t":"node","id":"express-connect","product":"express-connect","label":"Express Connect","group":"vpc","why":"Dedicated private line from your DC to Jakarta VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-onprem-express","from":"onprem-dc","to":"express-connect","label":"private link","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"mongodb","product":"mongodb","label":"Managed MongoDB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Document database for SaaS platform data."}
{"t":"node","id":"rds","product":"rds","label":"RDS PostgreSQL","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Relational database for structured SaaS data."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-express-mongo","from":"express-connect","to":"mongodb","label":"private","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-express-rds","from":"express-connect","to":"rds","label":"private","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"privatezone","product":"privatezone","label":"PrivateZone","group":"vpc","why":"Resolves DB endpoints internally without public DNS."}
{"t":"ask","id":"bandwidth","text":"What dedicated bandwidth do you need between your DC and Jakarta?","options":["100 Mbps","1 Gbps","10 Gbps"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"backup-region","text":"Do you need cross-region disaster recovery for these databases?","options":["No, Jakarta only","Yes, add Singapore replica"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"On-premises app servers connect over Express Connect to managed MongoDB and RDS PostgreSQL in a private Jakarta VPC with no internet exposure."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a photo-sharing backend with ECS behind an ALB, RDS for metadata, and OSS for images. No Function Compute."}
{"t":"req","text":"Company policy forbids serverless functions; no Function Compute","avoid":["fc"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","ecs","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"exposure","text":"Public-facing app","alt":"Internal only"}
{"t":"assume","id":"region","text":"Singapore region","alt":"Another region"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"App users","group":"internet","why":"People uploading and viewing photos."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the app domain to the load balancer."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"App VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes user requests across ECS instances."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the photo-sharing backend logic."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Metadata DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores user data and photo metadata."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"images","product":"oss","label":"Photo storage","group":"sg","why":"Stores uploaded images durably."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-images","from":"app","to":"images","label":"upload"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects application logs for monitoring."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"image-delivery","text":"How do users view photos?","options":["Direct from OSS via presigned URL","Through a CDN or ESA edge cache"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"scale","text":"What is your expected user scale?","options":["Under 10k users","10k to 100k users","Over 100k users"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Photo-sharing backend on ECS behind ALB, with RDS for metadata and OSS for image storage, avoiding Function Compute."}

{"t":"say","text":"Since Function Compute is forbidden, I'll add a Tair queue and a dedicated ECS worker to generate thumbnails from OSS events."}
{"t":"req","text":"Company policy forbids serverless functions; no Function Compute","avoid":["fc"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["smq","ecs"]}
{"t":"node","id":"queue","product":"smq","label":"Thumbnail queue","group":"sg","why":"Buffers new-photo events for async thumbnail processing."}
{"t":"node","id":"worker","product":"ecs","label":"Thumbnail workers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Polls the queue and generates thumbnails, avoiding Function Compute."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-queue","from":"app","to":"queue","label":"event","kind":"async"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-queue-worker","from":"queue","to":"worker","label":"poll","kind":"async"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-worker-images","from":"worker","to":"images","label":"read/write"}
{"t":"ask","id":"image-delivery","text":"How do users view photos?","options":["Direct from OSS via presigned URL","Through a CDN or ESA edge cache"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"scale","text":"What is your expected user scale?","options":["Under 10k users","10k to 100k users","Over 100k users"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added an SMQ queue and ECS thumbnail workers to process new photos without Function Compute."}

{"t":"say","text":"한국 개인정보보호법에 따라 모든 데이터를 서울 리전에 저장하는 게임 서버 아키텍처를 구성하겠습니다."}
{"t":"req","text":"이용자 개인정보 해외 반출 금지, 서울 리전 사용","regions":["ap-northeast-2"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls","nat"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"game-type","text":"일반 웹 기반 또는 API 호출 방식의 게임 서버","alt":"실시간 멀티플레이어 UDP 게임 서버"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"동시 접속자 약 1만 명 규모","alt":"동시 접속자 10만 명 이상"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"인터넷","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"플레이어","group":"internet","why":"게임에 접속하는 이용자들입니다."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Alibaba Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"게임 도메인을 ALB로 해석합니다."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"seoul","kind":"region","label":"서울 (ap-northeast-2)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"게임 VPC","parent":"seoul"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"두 가용영역으로 트래픽을 분산합니다."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"DDoS 및 악성 요청으로부터 게임 API를 보호합니다."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"game-server","product":"ecs","label":"게임 서버","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"서울 리전의 두 가용영역에서 게임 로직을 실행합니다."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"game-server","why":"접속자 수에 따라 서버를 자동 증설합니다."}
